     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CapabilityStatement MII-CPS-Metadata-Studie</b></p><a name=\"MII-CPS-Metadata-Studie\"> </a><a name=\"hcMII-CPS-Metadata-Studie\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">MII CPS Metadata Studie</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 2026.0.1 </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>xml</code>, <code>json</code></li><li>Published on: 2024-09-12 </li><li>Published by: Medizininformatik Initiative </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><h3 id=\"shallIGs\">SHALL Support the Following Implementation Guides</h3><ul><li>https://www.medizininformatik-initiative.de/fhir/modul-studie/ImplementationGuide|2026.0.1</li></ul><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>server</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"/></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET a resource (read interaction)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT a new resource version (update interaction)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST a new resource (create interaction)\">C</b></th><th><b title=\"Required and recommended search parameters\">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#PractitionerRole1-1\">PractitionerRole</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-studie-beteiligte-person.html\">MII PR Studie Beteiligte Person</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_id, _profile, practitioner, organization, role, telecom</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#DocumentReference1-2\">DocumentReference</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-studie-dokument.html\">MII PR Studie Dokument</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_id, _profile, author, custodian, status, location, contenttype, title, size, related</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Library1-3\">Library</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-studie-register.html\">MII PR Studie Register</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_id, _profile, name, identifier, quellregister, type, relatedArtifactUrl</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#ResearchStudy1-4\">ResearchStudy</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-studie-studie.html\">MII PR Studie Studie</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_id, _profile, identifier, title, status, partOf, category, armName, label, finanzierung, studienregister, rekrutierungsstand-datum, rekrutierungsstand-genauigkeit, rekrutierungsstand, rekrutierungsziel, rekrutierungsstart</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#EvidenceVariable1-5\">EvidenceVariable</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-studie-ein-auschluss-kriterium.html\">MII PR Studie EinAuschlussKriterium</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></span></td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>_id, _profile, status, characteristicDescription</td><td/><td/><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#ResearchSubject1-6\">ResearchSubject</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-mii-pr-studie-proband.html\">MII PR Studie Probandversion: 2026.0.1)</a></td><td class=\"text-center\"><span title=\"SHALL\"><b>Y</b></s